30,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"It seems hardware or physical assets complicate our reporting and audits significantly, though they offer better verification.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I've found that our capacity for software oversight is stretched thin, while our logistics expertise is currently underutilized.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is interesting to see that our most stable customers are in medical and field services, while physical operations were our biggest loss.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"We are spending follow-on capital much faster than planned for asset-heavy companies, and our credit line doesn't support software contracts.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Shion,,"I've noticed a pattern where specialized security reviews and hardware supply chains create massive, unpredictable delays before we see any real traction.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, if the software board seats are full, we should be cautious about adding more software-only companies.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree, Mizuki. We have a surplus of logistics expertise that we aren't using.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Misaki, if the credit line is restrictive, perhaps we should look for a balance between stability and flexibility.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Misaki,,Exactly. We need to be careful about how much liquidity we tie up in physical assets given the current burn.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Shion,,Logic suggests we avoid anything that triggers a three-quarter security delay or relies on fragile hardware components.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,So we are weighing the ease of reporting against the risk of audit delays and board saturation.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,And the ability to actually staff the company without waiting months for field crews.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I still believe the retention rates in medical and field sectors are very encouraging for long-term peace.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Misaki,,We must ensure the next investment doesn't drain our reserves prematurely.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Shion,,"If we want a predictable timeline, we should avoid the ""security review"" trap and the ""hardware shortage"" trap.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
